ithout test skips.\n\n## Plan\n- Document the three base dependencies.\n- Correct the MCP extra to `mcp>=1.28.1,<2` with PyJWT cryptography support.\n- Describe Anthropic, Bedrock, OpenAI, and Google provider installation accurately.\n- State that Git is a runtime prerequisite.\n- State that Git 2.38 is the development and test floor and that the S3 repair path also needs `merge-tree --write-tree`.\n- Change documentation only. Do not modify packaging.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] README dependency claims match `pyproject.toml`.\n- [x] Provider-extra guidance names the correct installation boundary for each provider.\n- [x] Git guidance preserves the enforced contributor and CI floor without presenting it as a universal floor for every runtime path.\n- [x] The S3 repair capability requirement remains discoverable.\n- [x] Targeted README and documentation checks pass.\n- [x] No dependency declaration or packaging file changes.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"README.md","reason":"Correct installation dependencies, provider extras, and Git requirements."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","e867-0f39-b887-40fa"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"e867-0f39-b887-40fa","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"2fec-767c-2829-4fc6","ticket_type":"story","title":"F08B correct README installation contracts","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["bb1df2c6-6120-4662-80c2-4f4bb0257770","84482db6-73cc-4e8f-959c-f4cd6baa0505"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788178808207399825,"uuid":"b2f08904-f033-4785-b8be-0a285962f71b"}